//! Minimal OOXML boilerplate shipped with every `.xlsx` package.
//!
//! Each constant is a verbatim OOXML payload that the writer injects
//! into the package alongside the freshly-built `xl/worksheets/sheet*.xml`.
//! They're kept as separate `&str` constants (rather than baked into
//! `write_excel_document` / `create_xlsx_workbook`) so tests and a
//! few external tools can splice them into a larger pipeline.
//!
//! Pulled out of `mod.rs` so the orchestrator stays focused on the
//! dynamic payload.

